            {
                "entry_id": "40ae686b-1833-3339-9e68-53dd5c93af48",
                "word": "anthropoid",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "ba1dbe29-59d6-407f-814b-a8b870729023",
                        "entry_id": "40ae686b-1833-3339-9e68-53dd5c93af48",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "anthropoids"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ae508e47-0958-3778-9686-4eee97631b82",
                        "entry_id": "40ae686b-1833-3339-9e68-53dd5c93af48",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An anthropoid animal."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "8dfa906c-7238-4f74-954d-df188a119139",
                                "sense_id": "ae508e47-0958-3778-9686-4eee97631b82",
                                "text": "The tribe of anthropoids over which Kerchak ruled with an iron hand and bared fangs, numbered some six or eight families, each family consisting of an adult male with his females and their young, numbering in all some sixty or seventy apes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c876d366-4848-4bd8-ba7f-124497bb4c3a",
                                "sense_id": "ae508e47-0958-3778-9686-4eee97631b82",
                                "text": "Here and there a little group of shattered Indians marked where one of the anthropoids had turned to bay, and sold his life dearly."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "22eb5ef2-1747-4edf-8810-70d069c60cf0",
                                "sense_id": "ae508e47-0958-3778-9686-4eee97631b82",
                                "text": "Imagine for a moment that mankind, together with the printed and artistic lore of all the ages, were suddenly destroyed. Any new race of anthropoids which might arise would be in precisely the same position as the primitive races of mankind were in the days of Adam and Eve, and little better than the animals of to-day."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "82e50989-37d1-4b16-ac2a-ef644d1d3e8c",
                        "source_entry_id": "40ae686b-1833-3339-9e68-53dd5c93af48",
                        "source_sense_id": "ae508e47-0958-3778-9686-4eee97631b82",
                        "source_sense_description": "an anthropoid animal",
                        "target_lang_word": "lidoop",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7e074fc8-243a-4f5a-a9e6-2fe81cfab46a",
                        "source_entry_id": "40ae686b-1833-3339-9e68-53dd5c93af48",
                        "source_sense_id": "ae508e47-0958-3778-9686-4eee97631b82",
                        "source_sense_description": "an anthropoid animal",
                        "target_lang_word": "anthropoïde",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "anthropoïde",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "81d04fae-b941-38b5-986d-59cc289e0af8",
                                        "entry_id": "6e43e56e-261e-3570-95c0-67a22b82a528",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Humain, qui ressemble à la forme humaine, en parlant d’un animal ou d’une représentation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0c0275c9-810b-4c55-8f2b-6f2feffedefc",
                                                "sense_id": "81d04fae-b941-38b5-986d-59cc289e0af8",
                                                "text": "M. Daily nous dit qu’il y a moins de différence entre un singe anthropoïde et l’homme qu’entre deux singes donnés ; nous lui demandons de vouloir bien nous dire quelles sont ces différences."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "87823ffa-dc8e-48e7-9274-03ad63355ad2",
                                                "sense_id": "81d04fae-b941-38b5-986d-59cc289e0af8",
                                                "text": "Dans l’univers virtuel de la simulation numérique, l’avatar anthropoïde, c’est moi."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "anthropoïde",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e2e2f2c4-f096-3624-8c80-f1d203effcf9",
                                        "entry_id": "929e61ce-8fc4-30d5-9e14-df880309955d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Primate évolué à morphologie proche de celle de l’humain. Les anthropoïdes sont les grands singes, c'est-à-dire les hominoïdes y compris l’humain et leurs prédécesseurs."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e2641196-e5b8-4189-979c-a9b40c764568",
                                                "sense_id": "e2e2f2c4-f096-3624-8c80-f1d203effcf9",
                                                "text": "Splendide spécimen d’anthropoïde frugivore dolichocéphale!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6cd0e744-08db-48c9-a64e-7f84eb10ac5a",
                                                "sense_id": "e2e2f2c4-f096-3624-8c80-f1d203effcf9",
                                                "text": "S’il est juste de dire que l’homme provient de l’animal, quelle différence cependant entre un anthropoïde et un homme."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3df4efa-4d9f-4893-b432-82810dbf3559",
                                                "sense_id": "e2e2f2c4-f096-3624-8c80-f1d203effcf9",
                                                "text": "Bientôt, les grands anthropoïdes campants et pique-niquants pourraient déambuler dans les campagnes avec leurs images chantantes et gigotantes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
